  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Add the water to a medium saucepan and bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.\n• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Slice carrot and cucumber into thin rounds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6855145e971405a9ee1edddf/step-3d56d000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Grate carrot.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6855145e971405a9ee1edddf/step-d37ffc10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Season with the cracked black pepper Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6855145e971405a9ee1edddf/step-bee52120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine carrot, cucumber, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of the vinegar and olive oil.\n• Toss to combine and season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6855145e971405a9ee1edddf/step-5b0dfd30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return saucepan to medium heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook corn, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Return rice to the saucepan and stir to combine.\n• Remove from heat.\n• Stir in Japanese-style dressing. Season to taste.\n• TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are “popping” out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6855145e971405a9ee1edddf/step-301d6940.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide charred corn-rice and cucumber salad between plates. Top rice with pepper plant-based crumbed chicken to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6855145e971405a9ee1edddf/step-6dd28350.jpg"
    }
  ]
